": true, "yearly_report_client_visible": false, "total_appeals_count": 0, "received_works": [{"path": "/@aridon/works/19", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 181734, "client_id": 2616430, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ce31c931/uploads/origins/e752009f-74b8-449c-9e39-a3e0f41c7335?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2071527566c8d1242c05dc24a8e4d0e6", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ce31c931/uploads/origins/e752009f-74b8-449c-9e39-a3e0f41c7335?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b51bb22c2c3ebea4a3bac64fd6ea535d", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは。\n先日は素敵なイラストを描いてくださりありがとうございました。とても好みでした。\nよろしければ、うちの子（OC）も描いてもらえると嬉しいです。\nよろしくお願いします。\n\n◆キャラ（うちの子）\n小日向 來音（こひなた くおん）\nhttps://skeb.jp/@nokunyan/works/9\n\n◆服装\n服装は参考画像のとおりでも良いです。\n\n◆シチュエーション\n本が好きな子なので、こんなポージングで本を読むシチュエーションをお願いしたいです。\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/120725185\n\n両足の爪先（特に爪が）ほぼ全て見えるように描いてもらえると嬉しいです。\n\n前作のこちらよりも、足の甲側の爪が多く見えている方が希望です。\nhttps://skeb.jp/@aridon/works/16\n\n◆表情\n集中して本を読んでいるので、こちらの視線には気づかない様子です。\n\n◆納品\nPSDとPNG形式\n（PSDを扱うソフトがないため、PNG形式も併せて納品頂けると助かります）\n\n◆宛名\n宛名は「Quon」でお願いします。", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@aridon/works/18", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 181734, "client_id": 41262, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/24cc1d8e/uploads/origins/dda12705-2154-4da0-9d2e-a3d1fc0f3d68?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e9e9bb969f0e1c0edacb3311d71c279d", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/24cc1d8e/uploads/origins/dda12705-2154-4da0-9d2e-a3d1fc0f3d68?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=823a15407c1897d69c05683f5313c9df", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！ 地雷系ファッションのナズーリンを描いてみませんか？ お好きなように描いてください！ いつもありがとうございます！   \n\nHello! Would you be interested in drawing Nazrin wearing 地雷系 fashion? Please draw it however you wish if so! Thank you very much always!", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@aridon/works/17", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 181734, "client_id": 41262, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/da5f61c8/uploads/origins/b2bf32c7-c2c2-499e-96c5-63417200478e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a2a8532ee558ba989fb6877de841d3c4", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/da5f61c8/uploads/origins/b2bf32c7-c2c2-499e-96c5-63417200478e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=08de769e00a53df210a25d86726b1c39", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！ ぐるぐる目をテーマにナズーリンを可愛く描いてくれませんか？ お任せします！ ありがとうございました！ \n\n Hello! Would you be able to draw Nazrin cutely with ぐるぐる目 as a theme? I'll leave everything up to you! Thank you very much!", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@aridon/works/16", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 181734, "client_id": 2616430, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ecba35b8/uploads/origins/44527537-7051-4f80-8316-78b0253f2551?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=372885bd01c847e6422424252cae4070", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls":